Package: svent-login
Architecture: all
Depends: lxdm, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xfonts-terminus
Description: Svent OS login manager configuration (LXDM)
 Minimal LXDM configuration for Svent OS: a dark greeter theme, a branded
 background, and the Svent session entries. No web greeter, just LXDM.
 Installing it makes LXDM the active display manager in place of GDM.